---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — China Layover Guide"
  description="How China Layover Guide handles your data."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <article class="prose prose-slate mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>This is a static, informational website. We do not require accounts or collect personal data.</p>
    <h2>What we don&rsquo;t collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>No accounts, no logins, no user-generated content.</li>
      <li>No advertising trackers in the initial version.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Third-party links</h2>
    <p>
      Pages link to official sources, map services, and payment providers. Those sites have their
      own privacy policies.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to the site owner.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
